<h1 id="submission-instructions">Submission Instructions</h1>

<p>Prospective authors are invited to submit original research contributions or extended abstracts of ongoing work relevant to the workshop theme. Submissions must adhere to the following guidelines:</p>

<ul>
  <li>Full papers: Up to 8 pages, excluding references, formatted according to the workshop template.</li>
  <li>Extended abstracts: Up to 2 pages, outlining the research problem, methodology, and preliminary results.</li>
  <li>All submissions must be in PDF format and adhere to the IEEE conference proceedings format.</li>
</ul>

